abstract: >-
  Standalone browser timer implementing the Minimum Effective Effort (MEE)
  9:30 session structure (1:00 dynamic priming + three 2:30 mechanical-tension
  rounds + 1:00 fascial unload). Open-core MIT extract accompanying the
  Create Paradise Now educational protocol on dense mechanical tension and
  insulin-independent GLUT4 framing.
